description: AssemblyAI STT — use live docs, never client-side keys
alwaysApply: false
---

Always fetch https://www.assemblyai.com/docs/llms.txt before writing AssemblyAI code.
The API has changed — do not rely on memorized parameter names.

- Pre-recorded: `speech_models: ["universal-3-5-pro", "universal-2"]`. Auth header is the raw key (no Bearer).
- Do not use deprecated `summarization`, `summary_model`, `summary_type`, or `auto_chapters`.
- Job title and description are generated from the transcript via OpenRouter after STT completes — never from the filename.
- Never put `ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY` or `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` in browser code. They live in Supabase Edge Function secrets only.
